{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年6月26日 16:53 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>天文台表示，位於珠江口以西的強雷雨區正逐漸東移，預料會在未來兩三小時影響珠江口一帶。（天文台）<br/> </p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T09:20:27.257554+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"unknown"}}